ss=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Logan County runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids had March to April at 197% of normal and November to December at 44%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 22% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 19031 shows a preliminary estimate of 38.8 for August to September 2026, built from NOAA rain and not RMA&rsquo;s final index.</p>"}
